Note the correct commands for using your bullwhip and your pick-axe.

The bullwhip should only be used with the (a) command: ie, don't hit
with it, but only apply it to steal weapons away from others.

The pick-axe, however, should be used with the (w) command, mainly:
immediately wield it and use it as your main weapon. When you meet a
dwarf carrying a mattock, wield that mattock instead. It's one of
NetHack's most damaging non-artifacts, and you can become expert in it.

Note that trying to fight a crocodile or dragon with a bullwhip is
certain to get you killed: it doesn't do *any* damage to thick-skinned
creatures.

